<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Entità"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, prov:Entity is used as a provenance category for linguistic objects whose attribution to an agent is documented, particularly declarations concerning literary constraints."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Entity"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, prov:Entity è utilizzata come categoria di provenienza per gli oggetti linguistici di cui viene documentata l'attribuzione a un agente, in particolare le dichiarazioni relative alle costrizioni letterarie."@it .
